# The parameter screen reads the firmware's own documentation, fetched as Mission Planner fetches it.
#
# On connect the vehicle is asked for its banner (DO_SEND_BANNER); the STATUSTEXT that names the
# vehicle carries the version; the documentation for that release is fetched into the data
# directory - the versioned file if the release has one, else the vehicle's unversioned file -
# and read before the bundled table. Needs SITL on tcp:127.0.0.1:5760 and either the network or
# a cached ArduCopter.apm.pdef.xml under ~/.local/share/Mission Planner, which a real Mission
# Planner installation leaves there.

screen params
window 1600x1200
settle 10

expect params.metadata.source ~ Copter
expect params.metadata.documented > 1000
